This code first sets the clear color to 86% red, 86% green, 86% blue, and 100% alpha, which
yields a gray color. The glClear call with the GL_COLOR_BUFFER_BIT parameter clears the
color buffer to the specified color. Finally, the SDL_GL_SwapWindow call swaps the front buffer
and back buffer. At this point, running the game yields a gray screen because you aren’t draw-
